{"kind":"assert","text":"Correction to ruling 4e4920bf, item 4, on your assert 6b4be951. A new\nAgent does not get a person past the refusal. The routes look up the\nmapping by controller and client, so the legacy row answers 503 for that\npair with any Agent.\n\nOption A stands. The note says what your source shows: a legacy binding\nrefuses new consent until the cutover retires its room, and a new client\nbinding for the same controller goes from provisional to confirmed. Keep\nthe witness that tells the two apart.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}